i Kernel is designed to standardize: deterministic execution, composability, permissionless settlement, discoverability, and security-aware smart contract design.\n\nDano Finance currently has approximately **USD 18M** **in TVL** and more than **10,000 on-chain transactions**, showing practical experience in the KPI categories this proposal is designed to improve: TVL, users, protocol activity, and liquidity growth.…\n# Criterion to evaluate\n**Not a duplicate of an existing solution**\nNo equivalent existing solution covers this, or this is meaningfully different.\n\nDoes an existing solution already cover what this proposal asks for? If 'yes', the treasury is being asked to fund work that already exists. If 'partial', there's overlap and the proposer needs to show how this is meaningfully different. 'No' or 'unknown' passes.\n# What I need from you\n1. Verdict: YES / NO / UNCLEAR — does this proposal meet the criterion?\n2. Confidence: LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH\n3. A short rationale (3–6 sentences) citing sources you actually checked (GitHub repos, Catalyst project pages, X/Twitter accounts, articles). Be honest if the public info is thin or the proposer's track-record claims need independent verification.\nPlease err on the…46:[\"$\",\"tr\",\"not-duplicate\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[color:var(--border)] align-top last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 pr-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-baseline font-medium\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Not a duplicate of an existing solution\"}],[\"$\",\"$L21\",null,{\"label\":\"Not a duplicate of an existing solution\",\"body\":\"Does an existing solution already cover what this proposal asks for? If 'yes', the treasury is being asked to fund work that already exists. If 'partial', there's overlap and the proposer needs to show how this is meaningfully different. 'No' or 'unknown' passes.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"m