rk because we are already building and operating Cardano DeFi infrastructure that follows the same principles the DeFi Kernel is designed to standardize: deterministic execution, composability, permissionless settlement, discoverability, and security-aware smart contract design.\n\nDano Finance currently has approximately **USD 18M** **in TVL** and more than **10,000 on-chain transactions**, showing practical experience in the KPI categories this proposal is designed to improve: TVL, users, protocol activity, and liquidity growth.…\n# Criterion to evaluate\n**Addresses active ecosystem demand**\nReal builders or users are asking for this and would adopt it. Not just a plausible idea — there is observable demand from existing projects or users.\n\nIs there real, observable demand from Cardano builders or users for this work? Strong demand means named users or integrators are asking for it and would adopt it. 'None' means it's a plausible idea but no one is currently using or asking for the thing being built. An upgrade to a tool with zero current users would fail this.\n# What I need from you\n1. Verdict: YES / NO / UNCLEAR "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"— does this proposal meet the criterion?\n2. Confidence: LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH\n3. A short rationale (3–6 sentences) citing sources you actually checked (GitHub repos, Catalyst project pages, X/Twitter accounts, artic…49:[\"$\",\"tr\",\"addresses-active-demand\",{\"className\":\"border-b border-[color:var(--border)] align-top last:border-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-3 pr-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-baseline font-medium\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Addresses active ecosystem demand\"}],[\"$\",\"$L21\",null,{\"label\":\"Addresses active ecosystem demand\",\"body\":\"Is there real, observable demand from Cardano builders or users for this work? Strong demand means named users or integrators are asking for it and woul